+        '- Web browsing, research, and summarization',
+        '- GitHub (issues, PRs, CI runs)',
+        '- Apple Notes & Reminders',
+        '- Image generation',
+        '- Weather forecasts',
+        '- PDF editing',
+        '- Audio transcription',
+        '- macOS automation',
+        '- And more — describe any task and OpenClaw will try to handle it',
